    "input": "search_document: I understand your frustration and concern regarding your personal data. I can provide the specific reasons for the retention policy and the process for deletion based on our handbook.\n\n**Why we retain data for 365 days**\nAccording to our Privacy policy, we retain personal data (including name, email, and shipping details) for exactly 365 days after your last purchase or account activity [privacy]. The handbook states that this retention period ensures that \"inactive customer records do not clutter our database while keeping active customer profiles up to date for future support interactions\" [privacy]. This allows us to maintain accurate profiles for customers who may need support or make future purchases within that year.\n\n**Regarding immediate deletion**\nYou have the right to request the deletion of your personal data [privacy]. However, the handbook does not support an \"immediate\" deletion guarantee. Instead, it outlines the following timeline:\n1.  We process deletion requests within **10 business days** of receipt [privacy].\n2.  If you request deletion, we will remove your data from our active systems within **14 days** [privacy].\n3.  We keep a log of the deletion request for **30 days** to prove compliance, after which the log is permanently erased [privacy].\n\nAdditionally, if you are deleting your account entirely, there is a **30-day \"cooling-off\" period** after you confirm the deletion request before personal data is permanently purged [accounts]. Please note that financial transaction records are retained for **7 years** to comply with tax regulations, regardless of your deletion request [accounts].\n\nTo proceed with a deletion request, you should use the \"Account Settings\" page to initiate the process, which will trigger the confirmation email and the timelines described above [accounts].\n\nIf you wish to escalate this matter further or if you feel these standard procedures do not address your specific concerns, I can offer to escalate the ticket to a human agent.",
    "model": "nomic-embed-text",
